    "body": "The owner requested a sustained local attack aimed at major mathematical closure, with extensive context and local command-line access, explicitly continuing beyond one or two milestones. The revised FUTURE S013 prompt makes L_all<=L_AS central; distinguishes global Q selection from ASH*; develops arbitrary-buffer, separate CLEAR-gap, structural-comparison and actual-disproof routes; requires follow-through after intermediate results; and permits larger bounded local plans hashed before execution.\n\nThis is an administrative handoff revision only. S012 remains last completed, S013 remains FUTURE/UNEXECUTED, and all mathematical state fields, claims, sources, research/code and historical evidence/hashes are unchanged. The original S012 closeout/future prompt stays frozen. An exact owner-request archive, hashed superseding full prompt, revision metadata and closeout-handoff addendum preserve provenance; governance validates both historical and current instructions.\n\nValidation: full governance, historical immutable hashes, prompt-mirror/required-scope checks and staged whitespace checks pass locally. Existing hosted workflow results will be verified from actual jobs. No research session, new search, delegation or deferred final-stage action executed.\n\nOne atomic authored administrative head `f831bce6a40a868b4a78c11dd5e74c995626edf5`, tree `1972a94f38e00b539062d255f6cca0d81e8e58b8`, sole parent/base `1505c1b8437973aa23bd09b6040a3ad39852f311`. Ordinary PR and non-force two-parent merge only; no auto-merge. Outgoing actual jobs/merge/main reread will be recorded here.\n",
